  "description": "Just before Princess Arabella Strovna’s 24th birthday, she and the entire imperial family die at the hands of the rebel army. Thanks to a magical blessing, though, she wakes up and she’s… 20 again? Trapped in a loop of rebirth, Arabella continues to repeat the same four years, only to be killed every time. To break the cycle, she must befriend her own murderers, the three rebel leaders. But as she gains their trust, Arabella realizes that they may not be the true villains of this tale…\n\n(Source: Tapas)",
